{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step onto the ice and experience hockey like never before in Casual Sport Series: Hockey! Whether you're a seasoned player or new to the rink, this vibrant, action-packed game delivers fast, easy-to-pick-up fun that anyone can enjoy. Perfect for solo play or intense local multiplayer showdowns with friends, it\u2019s the ultimate casual sports experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936440/extras/bf0398e161614934cebc1f2287bd8cb2.poster.avif?t=1728663528\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936440/extras/bf0398e161614934cebc1f2287bd8cb2.webm?t=1728663528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936440/extras/bf0398e161614934cebc1f2287bd8cb2.mp4?t=1728663528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of unique teams, each with its own playstyle and strategy. Every team comes with a distinctive home arena, making each match feel fresh and exciting as you compete across different, colorful environments. With stunning, high-quality cartoon graphics and dynamic visual effects, every game is a visual treat.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add to that smooth, intuitive controls and a fun, energetic soundtrack, and you\u2019ve got a hockey game that\u2019s as engaging as it is easy to play. Are you ready to lead your team to victory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936440/extras/27de3d4ace63d31d7570e33e309a1771.poster.avif?t=1728663528\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936440/extras/27de3d4ace63d31d7570e33e309a1771.webm?t=1728663528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936440/extras/27de3d4ace63d31d7570e33e309a1771.mp4?t=1728663528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2936440?t=1728663528","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936440/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1728663528","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936440/bad44f8bb0246c0c1ae8c6c8995473d35c663a3e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1728663528","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936440/bad44f8bb0246c0c1ae8c6c8995473d35c663a3e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1728663528","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step onto the ice and experience hockey like never before in Casual Sport Series: Hockey! Whether you're a seasoned player or new to the rink, this vibrant, action-packed game delivers fast, easy-to-pick-up fun that anyone can enjoy. Perfect for solo play or intense local multiplayer showdowns with friends, it\u2019s the ultimate casual sports experience!</p><p class=\"bb_parag